sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your App
    participant Init as init().await?
    participant LL as LazyLock Globals
    participant Env as Environment (.env)
    participant DB as Database

    App->>Init: oauth2_passkey_axum::init()
    Init->>LL: Force evaluate GENERIC_DATA_STORE
    LL->>Env: Read GENERIC_DATA_STORE_TYPE
    LL->>Env: Read GENERIC_DATA_STORE_URL
    Note over LL: match store_type
    alt sqlite
        LL->>DB: SqlitePool::connect_lazy()
    else postgres
        LL->>DB: PgPool::connect_lazy()
    else mysql
        LL->>DB: MySqlPool::connect_lazy()
    end
    LL-->>Init: Mutex<Box<dyn DataStore>>

    Init->>LL: Force evaluate config LazyLocks
    LL->>Env: Read O2P_*, SESSION_*, PASSKEY_*
    Note over LL: Panic on invalid values<br/>(fail fast at startup)
    Init-->>App: Ok(())

    Note over App: Any handler can now access<br/>GENERIC_DATA_STORE directly<br/>No State parameter needed
